-x  6 davidbean  staff   192 Sep 17 13:37 ..\\ndrwxr-xr-x  5 davidbean  staff   160 Sep 17 13:37 criteria\\n-rw-r--r--  1 davidbean  staff  1905 Sep 17 13:37 spec.md\\ndrwxr-xr-x  5 davidbean  staff   160 Sep 17 13:37 stub\\n---\\n## Problem\\n\\nAn invocation that begins and does not end leaves nothing. On 2026-09-17 two build attempts of item #148 died between passing their gates and writing their record: the first with its spawning process, the second under a live one; each left a worktree holding an unrecorded executor commit, no record, no stop, and no line anywhere the product owns. `attavo doctor` held on both, because every proof reads records and a dead invocation writes none; the operator screen rendered the row from the last record and so showed a failed attempt as the whole truth while nothing ran; recovery was three hand-written shell blocks. The product has no primitive for \\\"this invocation began\\\", so nothing can say \\\"and it did not end\\\".\\n\\nRetires: the by-hand recovery of a dead or hung drive (the worktree removed, the branch reset, the events archived by a person); the screen's in-memory notion of a running drive as the only witness that one runs; silence as an outcome.\\n\\n## Claims\\n\\n- bin/attavo\\n- schema/records/build.schema.json\\n- schema/records/verify.schema.json\\n- schema/manifest.schema.json\\n- attavo.toml\\n- tests/test_doctor.py\\n- tests/test_drive.py\\n- tests/test_ledger.py\\n\\n## Criteria\\n\\n- doctor-fails-on-an-invocation-without-record.sh: on a fixture tenant with a build-01.started marker naming a dead pid on this host and no build-01.json, attavo doctor --json fails proof no-invocation-lacks-record naming build-01, and holds once build-01.json exists\\n- recover-writes-a-died-record.sh: on the same fixture, attavo drive --recover 1 writes build-01.json with status failed and stop class died, provenance product, with a log beside it, committed by the driver identity with a clean tree, after which proof five holds\\n- died-and-hung-are-stop-classes.sh: both stage schemas' stop enums name died and hung, the manifest schema declares [drive].stall_after_s, and bin/attavo's STOP_CLASSES names both\",\"is_error\":false}]},\"parent_tool_use_id\":null,\"session_id\":\"f081a203-e2ee-47b3-8bf8-5fc3aaeb804d\",\"uuid\":\"d2acfca5-9219-490b-a189-6359488ca460\",\"timestamp\":\"2026-09-17T19:40:25.523Z\",\"tool_use_result\":{\"stdout\":\"total 12128\\ndrwxr-xr-x  14 davidbean  staff      448 Sep 17 13:37 .\\ndrwxr-xr-x   6 davidbean  staff      192 Sep 17 13:37 ..\\n-rw-r--r--   1 davidbean  staff      274 Sep 17 13:37 approval-01.json\\n-rw-r--r--   1 davidbean  staff       44 Sep 17 13:37 build-01.filed\\n-rw-r--r--   1 davidbean  staff     1066 Sep 17 13:37 build-01.json\\n-rw-r--r--   1 davidbean  staff  2625035 Sep 17 13:37 build-01.log\\n-rw-r--r--   1 davidbean  staff       44 Sep 17 13:37 build-02.filed\\n-rw-r--r--   1 davidbean  staff     1115 Sep 17 13:37 build-02.json\\n-rw-r--r--   1 davidbean  staff     1269 Sep 17 13:37 build-02.log\\n-rw-r--r--   1 davidbean  staff     1647 Sep 17 13:37 counsel-01.json\\n-rw-r--r--   1 davidbean  staff  2302287 Sep 17 13:37 counsel-01.log\\n-rw-r--r--   1 davidbean  staff     3543 Sep 17 13:37 counsel-02.json\\n-rw-r--r--   1 davidbean  staff  1238408 Sep 17 13:37 counsel-02.log\\n-rw-r--r--   1 davidbean  staff      650 Sep 17 13:37 spec-01.json\\n---\\ntotal 8\\ndrwxr-xr-x  5 davidbean  staff   160 Sep 17 13:37 .\\ndrwxr-xr-x  6 davidbean  staff   192 Sep 17 13:37 ..\\ndrwxr-xr-x  5 davidbean  staff   160 Sep 17 13:37 criteria\\n-rw-r--r--  1 davidbean  staff  1905 Sep 17 13:37 spec.md\\ndrwxr-xr-x  5 davidbean  staff   160 Sep 17 13:37 stub\\n---\\n## Problem\\n\\nAn invocation that begins and does not end leaves nothing. On 2026-09-17 two build attempts of item #148 died between passing their gates and writing their record: the first with its spawning process, the second under a live one; each left a worktree holding an unrecorde