      if exit_code2 is not None:\n/Users/davidbean/Projects/attest/adapters/claude-code/run:926:            return exit_code2\n/Users/davidbean/Projects/attest/schema/records/build.schema.json:111:          \"enum\": [\"non-question\", \"outlived-invocation\", \"no-cause\", \"forge-unconcluded\",\n/Users/davidbean/Projects/attest/schema/records/build.schema.json:118:          \"description\": \"Populated for class \\\"unclassed\\\" (the log's last line, capped at 200 characters), class \\\"question\\\" (the halt's own question, its first line only), class \\\"environment\\\" ([checks].command's last output line, capped at 200 characters), and class \\\"gate\\\" (a refused spec-gate record's own refusal string, issue #137 -- never persisted on an actual build record; read here only because stop_class_enum sources the enum from this schema); null for every other class, whose evidence already lives in refusal, halted, or the log itself.\"\n/Users/davidbean/Projects/attest/schema/records/verify.schema.json:113:          \"enum\": [\"non-question\", \"outlived-invocation\", \"no-cause\", \"forge-unconcluded\",\n/Users/davidbean/Projects/attest/schema/records/counsel.schema.json:55:      \"description\": \"\\\"failed\\\" when the adapter exited non-zero or returned no usable structured answer; class, verdict, citations, and proposal are then null/empty.\"\n/Users/davidbean/Projects/attest/schema/records/counsel.schema.json:59:      \"enum\": [\"non-question\", \"outlived-invocation\", \"no-cause\", \"forge-unconcluded\",\n/Users/davidbean/Projects/attest/schema/records/counsel.schema.json:61:      \"description\": \"The stop's class as counsel itself reads it -- independent of, and possibly disagreeing with, the stop.class the counseled record already carries.\"\n--- product version ---\ngit: warning: confstr() failed with code 5: couldn't get path of DARWIN_USER_TEMP_DIR; using /tmp instead\ngit: error: couldn't create cache file '/tmp/xcrun_db-KUgAUvL6' (errno=Operation